00:04:29.828 --> 00:04:31.370
that are running in
your application,

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.150
you would define your container
registry addresses in there.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:38.600
It would pick up
from those addresses

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.782
and deploy your service in GKE.

00:04:40.782 --> 00:04:41.490
SPEAKER 1: Great.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.050
PRIYANKA VERGADIA: Yeah.

